Package: cdtr
Title: Constrained Delaunay Triangulation with Refinement via CDT
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Spike binding to the artem-ogre/CDT header-only C++ library (MPL-2.0):
    constrained and conforming Delaunay triangulation, Ruppert refinement by
    area or minimum angle, resolution of crossing constraints, and topological
    region depth per triangle. Aimed at replacing RTriangle in anglr.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++11
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
